# howto: drive routes

lost? run `rhx route.drive`: shows the current stone and next step.

| signal | when |
|---|---|
| `--as passed` | work complete, proceed |
| `--as arrived` | work complete, request review |
| `--as absorbed --that <slug>` | you replied to a peer reviewer; required before re-arrive |
| `--as blocked` | genuine wall, only after you replied to what you could |

you cannot grant `--as approved`; only humans. if a guard demands it, signal `--as arrived` and wait.

self-reviews: the review IS the work. peer reviews: address all blockers, maximize nitpick fixes.

disagree? that is a `[REFUTE]` in your `.taken`, never a halt: argue with cited evidence, `--as absorbed --that <slug>`, re-arrive. a code fix is not a reply either (`rule.forbid.unanswered-exits-from-a-blocker`).
